{"seq":2,"slug":"dev-toolchain-automation","title":"开发工具链安装自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/macos-dev-environment/dev-toolchain-automation","wordCount":737,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"开发工具链安装自动化\">开发工具链安装自动化</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>macOS 开发环境不仅需要 Homebrew 管理的 CLI 工具和 GUI 应用，还需要一整套开发工具链：Xcode CLI Tools 提供编译器基础、各语言运行时需要版本管理、编辑器需要插件和 LSP 配置、容器运行时和数据库也是日常开发的刚需。将这些组件的安装和版本管理自动化，是从&quot;每次换机折腾两天&quot;到&quot;一键完成&quot;的关键跨越。</p>\n<p>本文聚焦于如何用 mise（前身为 rtx）统一管理多语言运行时版本，以及如何将完整开发工具链的安装编排为可复现的自动化流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"macos-开发工具链层次\">macOS 开发工具链层次</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    X[&quot;Xcode CLI Tools - 编译器基础&quot;] --&gt; HB[&quot;Homebrew - 包管理&quot;]&#10;    HB --&gt; CLI[&quot;CLI 工具 - git, rg, fd...&quot;]&#10;    HB --&gt; RT[&quot;运行时管理器 - mise&quot;]&#10;    RT --&gt; N[&quot;Node.js 多版本&quot;]&#10;    RT --&gt; P[&quot;Python 多版本&quot;]&#10;    RT --&gt; G[&quot;Go 多版本&quot;]&#10;    RT --&gt; R[&quot;Rust toolchain&quot;]&#10;    HB --&gt; APP[&quot;GUI 应用 - Ghostty, VS Code&quot;]&#10;    HB --&gt; DB[&quot;数据库 - PostgreSQL, Redis&quot;]&#10;    HB --&gt; CT[&quot;容器 - Docker Desktop&quot;]\">graph TD\n    X[\"Xcode CLI Tools - 编译器基础\"] --&gt; HB[\"Homebrew - 包管理\"]\n    HB --&gt; CLI[\"CLI 工具 - git, rg, fd...\"]\n    HB --&gt; RT[\"运行时管理器 - mise\"]\n    RT --&gt; N[\"Node.js 多版本\"]\n    RT --&gt; P[\"Python 多版本\"]\n    RT --&gt; G[\"Go 多版本\"]\n    RT --&gt; R[\"Rust toolchain\"]\n    HB --&gt; APP[\"GUI 应用 - Ghostty, VS Code\"]\n    HB --&gt; DB[\"数据库 - PostgreSQL, Redis\"]\n    HB --&gt; CT[\"容器 - Docker Desktop\"]</pre><h3 id=\"mise-统一版本管理\">mise 统一版本管理</h3><p>mise（发音 &quot;meez&quot;）是 2024-2026 年崛起的统一版本管理器，取代了过去需要分别安装 nvm、pyenv、rbenv 等多个工具的局面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>传统方案</th>\n<th>mise</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>nvm / fnm</td>\n<td><code>mise use node@22</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>pyenv</td>\n<td><code>mise use python@3.13</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>goenv</td>\n<td><code>mise use go@1.23</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ruby</td>\n<td>rbenv</td>\n<td><code>mise use ruby@3.3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>jenv / sdkman</td>\n<td><code>mise use java@21</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置文件</td>\n<td>每个工具一个</td>\n<td>统一 <code>.mise.toml</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shell 集成</td>\n<td>每个工具修改 PATH</td>\n<td>一次初始化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"mise-toml-配置\">.mise.toml 配置</h3><p>每个项目根目录放一个 <code>.mise.toml</code>，声明该项目需要的运行时版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# .mise.toml（项目级）&#10;[tools]&#10;node = &quot;22&quot;&#10;python = &quot;3.13&quot;&#10;go = &quot;1.23&quot;&#10;&#10;[env]&#10;NODE_ENV = &quot;development&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># .mise.toml（项目级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[tools]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>node = \"22\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>python = \"3.13\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>go = \"1.23\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[env]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>NODE_ENV = \"development\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>全局配置放在 <code>~/.config/mise/config.toml</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# ~/.config/mise/config.toml（全局）&#10;[tools]&#10;node = &quot;lts&quot;&#10;python = &quot;latest&quot;&#10;go = &quot;latest&quot;&#10;usage = &quot;latest&quot;&#10;&#10;[settings]&#10;experimental = true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ~/.config/mise/config.toml（全局）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[tools]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>node = \"lts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>python = \"latest\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>go = \"latest\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>usage = \"latest\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[settings]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>experimental = true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"xcode-command-line-tools\">Xcode Command Line Tools</h3><p>这是一切的基础——Homebrew、Git、编译器都依赖它：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装（会弹出系统对话框）&#10;xcode-select --install&#10;&#10;# 验证&#10;xcode-select -p&#10;# 输出: /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools&#10;&#10;# 检查版本&#10;clang --version&#10;git --version&#10;make --version\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装（会弹出系统对话框）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xcode-select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xcode-select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出: /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clang</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果之前安装过完整 Xcode 需要切换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 切换到独立的 CLI Tools（不需要完整 Xcode）&#10;sudo xcode-select --switch /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 切换到独立的 CLI Tools（不需要完整 Xcode）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> xcode-select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --switch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"mise-完整配置\">mise 完整配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 mise&#10;brew install mise&#10;&#10;# Shell 集成（~/.zshrc）&#10;eval &quot;$(mise activate zsh)&quot;&#10;&#10;# 或 Fish（~/.config/fish/config.fish）&#10;mise activate fish | source&#10;&#10;# 安装运行时&#10;mise use --global node@lts       # 全局 Node.js LTS&#10;mise use --global python@3.13    # 全局 Python 3.13&#10;mise use --global go@latest      # 全局最新 Go&#10;&#10;# 项目级版本（在项目目录执行）&#10;cd ~/projects/my-app&#10;mise use node@20                  # 该项目使用 Node 20&#10;&#10;# 查看当前激活的版本&#10;mise ls&#10;&#10;# 查看所有可用版本&#10;mise ls-remote node\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 mise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Shell 集成（~/.zshrc）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mise</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> activate zsh)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或 Fish（~/.config/fish/config.fish）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mise</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> activate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fish</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装运行时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mise</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> use</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node@lts</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 全局 Node.js LTS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mise</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> use</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python@3.13</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 全局 Python 3.13</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mise</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> use</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> go@latest</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 全局最新 Go</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 项目级版本（在项目目录执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/projects/my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mise</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> use</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node@20</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  # 该项目使用 Node 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看当前激活的版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mise</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看所有可用版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mise</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls-remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"核心开发工具安装清单\">核心开发工具安装清单</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# === 编辑器 ===&#10;brew install neovim&#10;brew install --cask visual-studio-code&#10;brew install --cask cursor  # AI 编辑器&#10;&#10;# === Git 增强 ===&#10;brew install gh             # GitHub CLI&#10;brew install lazygit        # TUI Git 客户端&#10;brew install git-delta      # 更好的 diff&#10;brew install git-secrets    # 密钥泄露检测&#10;&#10;# === 容器与虚拟化 ===&#10;brew install --cask docker  # Docker Desktop&#10;brew install docker-compose&#10;brew install colima         # 轻量级 Docker 运行时替代&#10;&#10;# === 数据库 ===&#10;brew install postgresql@16&#10;brew install redis&#10;brew install sqlite&#10;&#10;# === API 工具 ===&#10;brew install httpie&#10;brew install grpcurl&#10;brew install --cask postman&#10;&#10;# === 基础设施 ===&#10;brew install terraform&#10;brew install kubectl&#10;brew install helm&#10;brew install awscli\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># === 编辑器 ===</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> neovim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cask</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> visual-studio-code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cask</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cursor</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # AI 编辑器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># === Git 增强 ===</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B3